<title>USA: Enhance Financial to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Enhance Financial to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enhance Financial Services Group Inc said on Thursday its board authorized a share repurchase program for up to 750,000 shares of its common stock, to be bought through open market transactions.</p>
<p>Enhance also said it was terminating its August 1992 share repurchase program, which had 173,400 remaining shares which could have been repurchased.</p>
<p>Repurchased shares would be held as Treasury shares, available for reissuance for the company's employee and director stock incentive compensation plans, Enhance said.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
